      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood sits on an alluvial flood plain between the Hollywood Hills and Baldwin Hills, where hill sediment created hard pan clay that locals topsoil for gardening.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
