      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Larchmont Village sprang up in the late 1800s and by the 1920s became a streetcar suburb, with most houses built during the film‑industry boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        22,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
