      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Larchmont Chronicle, founded in 1963 by Jane Gilman and Dawne Goodwin, remains the print newspaper that has chronicled the community for decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Larchmont%2C_Los_Angeles",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Larchmont borders Hollywood to the north, Hancock Park to the west, and Koreatown to the southeast, placing it amid some of Los Angeles’ most vibrant neighborhoods.",
